\f0\fs20\b\cf1 3. Summary of Findings from Literature\b0\cf0\par
\f1\fs19
1. \b Hata et al. (2004)\b0 : Equilibrated Ba-Se(IV)-H\dn2 2\up0 O systems at 25 \u176?C. BaSeO\dn2 3\up0  forms in neutral/alkaline solutions (pH 4.6-13.7) and matches JCPDS card No. 8-268.\par
2. \b Yang et al. (2021)\b0 : Reported BaSeO\dn2 3\up0  as a secondary phase precipitate (~16 wt%) in Bi\dn2 1-x\up0 Ba\dn2 x\up0 CuSeO ceramics when x \u8805? 0.175. The Rietveld refinement yielded unit cell parameters a = 4.5107 \u198?, b = 5.9923 \u198?, c = 7.1309 \u198? with GOF = 1.426.
